  <diagram id="bnOPrr4MtUn9x5Dc42bO" name="LoRa">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1634" dy="1293" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="VDmUDdtNuw6Q_9KFs9xD-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- Operating Voltage VCC:&amp;nbsp; min.1.8&amp;nbsp; typ.3.3 max.3.6 Volts (V)&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- Operating Current:&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- BLE TX Mode **12.7mA** @4.0 dBm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- LORA TX Mode **87mA** @ 20 dBm, 868 MHz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- Sleep current: 2.37µA&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- I²C, SPI &amp;amp; UART&amp;nbsp;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- default = **UART0** (AT commands en FW updates)&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&amp;nbsp; default 115200 baud, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit, no parity&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&amp;nbsp; debug pinnen op UART0 (RAK kan ook met pc communiceren ([WisToolBox](https://docs.rakwireless.com/product-categories/software-tools/wistoolbox/overview))&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&amp;nbsp; evt. UART met USB rechtstreeks? (multiplex via jumper pins)&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- 2x MHF-4&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- [AT commands: RAKwireless Unified Interfave V3 (RUI3)](https://docs.rakwireless.com/product-categories/software-apis-and-libraries/rui3/overview/)&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- interfaced with an external host via [AT command mode (default)](https://docs.rakwireless.com/product-categories/software-apis-and-libraries/rui3/at-command-manual/)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- custom serial interface can be created by the user using [Custom Mode](https://docs.rakwireless.com/product-categories/software-apis-and-libraries/rui3/custom-mode/)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;- AT commands ook via I2C en SPI? Of worden deze alleen gebruikt bij custom firmware (RAK als master)?&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;​Antennes: MHF4&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;Make sure that an antenna is always connected. Using these transceivers&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;without an antenna can damage the module&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="679" width="579" x="-193" y="-207" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
